    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ header file with inline implementations for the µTest++ test runner. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the inline accessors of the <computeroutput>runner</computeroutput> class and the inline template implementation for <computeroutput>runner::add_suite()</computeroutput>, the member function used to create and register a named test suite with a <computeroutput>runner</computeroutput> instance, and for its deprecated alias <computeroutput>runner::suite()</computeroutput>. It constructs a <computeroutput>suite</computeroutput> object on the heap (wrapped in <computeroutput>std::unique_ptr</computeroutput>) and transfers ownership to the runner via <computeroutput>register_suite()</computeroutput>; the suite is run later, by <computeroutput>run_suites()</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>The implementation is separated into this inline header so that the template definition is visible at every call site without cluttering the main <computeroutput><ref refid="runner_8h" kindref="compound">runner.h</ref></computeroutput> declaration file.</para>
<para>This file is included by <computeroutput><ref refid="runner_8h" kindref="compound">runner.h</ref></computeroutput>; the applications include <computeroutput><ref refid="micro-test-plus_8h" kindref="compound">micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h</ref></computeroutput>, not this file. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
